Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.214.211.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"338cc7772e02c60070aa88aac43aa81a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"stephygirl\"] Thank so much for your input! I do feel good knowing that you had such a good experience. &amp;nbsp;Yanet did actually write me back today and tell me that I can use the Palenque Terrace for my cocktail hour now. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m not sure what the confusion was, but I think I&#039;m just going to go with it! &amp;nbsp;I kind of want my cocktail hour to be in a different place than the reception area, just so that the space won&#039;t look as cluttered (although maybe it wouldn&#039;t?). I also don&#039;t want people to sit at their tables and such during cocktail hour - I would rather people be mingling and then the reception space be a surprise. I know that everything will work out... I think knowing it&#039;s less than six months away is just making me stressed! HA! &amp;nbsp;I really appreciate all of your reassurance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903681,"PostDate":1440760864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> Thank so much for your input! I do feel good knowing that you had such a good experience. \u00a0Yanet did actually write me back today and tell me that I can use the Palenque Terrace for my cocktail hour now. \u00a0I'm not sure what the confusion was, but I think I'm just going to go with it! \u00a0I kind of want my cocktail hour to be in a different place than the reception area, just so that the space won't look as cluttered (although maybe it wouldn't?). I also don't want people to sit at their tables and such during cocktail hour - I would rather people be mingling and then the reception space be a surprise. I know that everything will work out... I think knowing it's less than six months away is just making me stressed! HA! \u00a0I really appreciate all of your reassurance!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421792707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"829feefbf8e355da54f0b3fdd546af1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] - Glad it all sorted itself out! &amp;nbsp;I definitely know what you mean about wanting a special place for the reception. &amp;nbsp;I felt the same way.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So exciting that it&#039;s coming up soon! &amp;nbsp;No need to stress, it will all turn out great. &amp;nbsp;We planned ours in less than 5 months and had the best time!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903727,"PostDate":1440838623,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> - Glad it all sorted itself out! \u00a0I definitely know what you mean about wanting a special place for the reception. \u00a0I felt the same way.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So exciting that it's coming up soon! \u00a0No need to stress, it will all turn out great. \u00a0We planned ours in less than 5 months and had the best time!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432713563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"85.255.235.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea099fd90da7821a6ce309993bb927fe","RawContent":"Thanks @[member=\"stephygirl\"]! I haven&#039;t been on here for a while as been so busy recently, sorry for not thanking you sooner.\n\n\nBooked my hair and makeup in for 11am...very excited! \n\n\nEmailed my coordinator, who sent me info regarding the companies to contact re the Charicaturist but still no replies from either! Will keep chasing though. \n\n\nI&#039;d like a sparkler exit, so would be used outside only. \n\n\nI decided to keep my ceremony at 3pm.....you&#039;re right, it will still be hot regardless and I really want to have good lighting for our pics. \n\n\nHaven&#039;t heard about Mercado 23, will have a look into it. \n\n\nThanks again [emoji4]","Attachments":[],"Id":1904978,"PostDate":1442552300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a>! I haven't been on here for a while as been so busy recently, sorry for not thanking you sooner.<br><br>\nBooked my hair and makeup in for 11am...very excited! <br><br>\nEmailed my coordinator, who sent me info regarding the companies to contact re the Charicaturist but still no replies from either! Will keep chasing though. <br><br>\nI'd like a sparkler exit, so would be used outside only. <br><br>\nI decided to keep my ceremony at 3pm.....you're right, it will still be hot regardless and I really want to have good lighting for our pics. <br><br>\nHaven't heard about Mercado 23, will have a look into it. <br><br>\nThanks again [emoji4] \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420489204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1973,"TotalPages":198,"CurrentPage":1970,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":1960,"LastPage":1970},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
