{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a799ec77fe12c9ccdf43b550f693a66f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Looks like you had a gorgeous day for your wedding!&amp;nbsp; Congratulations!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547177,"PostDate":1321392212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Looks like you had a gorgeous day for your wedding!\u00a0 Congratulations!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dacia99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1313275502,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243840.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dacia","Id":243840,"Name":"Dacia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a910dff5befcb61b088ce86b138e3cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi, how did&amp;nbsp; everything go? I am on the fence about having it a BP so please fill&amp;nbsp;ME in.... &amp;nbsp;can you put up some pics?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1548095,"PostDate":1321603474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, how did\u00a0 everything go? I am on the fence about having it a BP so please fill\u00a0ME in.... \u00a0can you put up some pics?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley.dicesare@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1320663423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247444.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashley927","Id":247444,"Name":"ashley927","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b08461bc4e10531795509a2bf364ce4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Beautiful thanks for posting!!!&amp;nbsp; Do u have any from your reception would love to see those to get an idea? Thanks :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1548105,"PostDate":1321604394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Beautiful thanks for posting!!!\u00a0 Do u have any from your reception would love to see those to get an idea? Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley.dicesare@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1320663423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247444.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashley927","Id":247444,"Name":"ashley927","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14c2601af70321073d5c5d453749ecac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re getting married at Beach Palace on December 3rd with 35 guests, so we&#039;ll make sure to get tons of pictures to post on here.&amp;nbsp; I was totally in the same boat of feeling uncomfortable without being able to find too many pictures or wedding reviews, but so far we&#039;ve been really happy with the planning process and options, and we can&#039;t wait to have the ceremony there!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here&#039;s what we have booked:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; No rehearsal (there is a $200 set-up fee&amp;nbsp;to use the area, and I thought it was kind of a waste), but we&#039;re doing a welcome cocktail hour with appetizers&amp;nbsp;on the beach on Friday from 4-5pm.&amp;nbsp; We skipped doing a full dinner since we didn&#039;t want it to feel too much like the wedding.&amp;nbsp; *FYI - there&#039;s an additional $6pp charge to use the beach area on top of the regular charge for the cocktail hour.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; Ceremony at 4:30pm on Saturday on the rooftop sky terrace.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re going with the Diamond package because I didn&#039;t want to worry about decorations, and it included some things that we would paid separately for (photography, a musician for the ceremony, fireworks, cake,&amp;nbsp;and video), so it ended up being worth it overall.&amp;nbsp; Plus, we applied all of our $1500 resort credit towards it.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; Private function dinner on South Terrace (pool side on the level&amp;nbsp;right below the ceremony location) from 5:30-8:30pm (ditto on additional charge for using this location versus some of the other spots that are free)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; Mariachi band for 45 minutes during dinner&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; Upgraded photography session&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; We contemplated getting a sound system to be able to play an iPod&amp;nbsp;for our background dinner music (we don&#039;t want dancing), but our parents are just going to bring their Bose docking station, so we&#039;ll use that instead.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; Lounge furniture from the decor company through the resort&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m sorry for the super long post, but hopefully, this will be somewhat helpful!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1548723,"PostDate":1321791392,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're getting married at Beach Palace on December 3rd with 35 guests, so we'll make sure to get tons of pictures to post on here.\u00a0 I was totally in the same boat of feeling uncomfortable without being able to find too many pictures or wedding reviews, but so far we've been really happy with the planning process and options, and we can't wait to have the ceremony there!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here's what we have booked:<\/p> <ul> <li> No rehearsal (there is a $200 set-up fee\u00a0to use the area, and I thought it was kind of a waste), but we're doing a welcome cocktail hour with appetizers\u00a0on the beach on Friday from 4-5pm.\u00a0 We skipped doing a full dinner since we didn't want it to feel too much like the wedding.\u00a0 *FYI - there's an additional $6pp charge to use the beach area on top of the regular charge for the cocktail hour.<\/li> <li> Ceremony at 4:30pm on Saturday on the rooftop sky terrace.\u00a0 We're going with the Diamond package because I didn't want to worry about decorations, and it included some things that we would paid separately for (photography, a musician for the ceremony, fireworks, cake,\u00a0and video), so it ended up being worth it overall.\u00a0 Plus, we applied all of our $1500 resort credit towards it.<\/li> <li> Private function dinner on South Terrace (pool side on the level\u00a0right below the ceremony location) from 5:30-8:30pm (ditto on additional charge for using this location versus some of the other spots that are free)<\/li> <li> Mariachi band for 45 minutes during dinner<\/li> <li> Upgraded photography session<\/li> <li> We contemplated getting a sound system to be able to play an iPod\u00a0for our background dinner music (we don't want dancing), but our parents are just going to bring their Bose docking station, so we'll use that instead.<\/li> <li> Lounge furniture from the decor company through the resort<\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm sorry for the super long post, but hopefully, this will be somewhat helpful!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarichristianson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295797984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235902.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saric83","Id":235902,"Name":"saric83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c42aa74c040cb79e3e08e70bbcf5536","RawContent":"Can I ask how much was the Dj? \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]alysam4785[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1552695,"PostDate":1322745400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Can I ask how much was the Dj?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>alysam4785<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mz_priya@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"108.173.31.172","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313499312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243976.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mizpriya","Id":243976,"Name":"mizpriya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23fd27db2d8ed7d772529c9bb4dcad7f","RawContent":"Did you bring that diamond bead curtain with you down for the wedding ceremony? I&#039;m not sure which ones come with the complimentary and I know I saw this in the diamond package...\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]alysam4785[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590276\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590278\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590280\/width\/525\/height\/700[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590282\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590284\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1552696,"PostDate":1322745542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did you bring that diamond bead curtain with you down for the wedding ceremony? I'm not sure which ones come with the complimentary and I know I saw this in the diamond package...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>alysam4785<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"457.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590276\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"495.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590278\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"448.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590280\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"469.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590282\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"550.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/590284\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mz_priya@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"108.173.31.172","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313499312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243976.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mizpriya","Id":243976,"Name":"mizpriya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8e2b8630874cbfba13f7fcee5007d63","RawContent":"$800 [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mizpriya[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Can I ask how much was the Dj? \n \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1553020,"PostDate":1322823895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> $800<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mizpriya<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Can I ask how much was the Dj?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alysam4785@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294695297,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235370.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alysam4785","Id":235370,"Name":"alysam4785","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cd014a6cf6bd65f63e9e38530f25235","RawContent":"NO actually my WC Mario did that on his own : ) [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mizpriya[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Did you bring that diamond bead curtain with you down for the wedding ceremony? I&#039;m not sure which ones come with the complimentary and I know I saw this in the diamond package...\n   \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1553021,"PostDate":1322823934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> NO actually my WC Mario did that on his own : )<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mizpriya<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Did you bring that diamond bead curtain with you down for the wedding ceremony? I'm not sure which ones come with the complimentary and I know I saw this in the diamond package...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alysam4785@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294695297,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235370.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alysam4785","Id":235370,"Name":"alysam4785","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08f31682742d4838e92068d34e017f79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies!&amp;nbsp; We just got back from BP, and we loved it!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; There were definitely a few little snafus along the way, but we&#039;re so happy with the overall way everything turned out.&amp;nbsp; Here are some pictures....If you want to see more or have any specific questions that I can help with, let me know! :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Welcome cocktail hour on the beach&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Welcome Cocktail Hour on the beach\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607111\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC03894.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607138\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Beautiful&amp;nbsp;rooms!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC03951.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607113\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Diamond wedding package set-up (but I think these are all being replaced by different packages : ()&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC03959.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607115\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We had a private function dinner at the South Sky Terrace (that and the north are the exact same set-up)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC03977.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607117\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Another angle, so you can see the side.&amp;nbsp; FYI - the tiki torches were rented separately through the decor company.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC03979.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607119\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Another angle....all of our tables are set up to the left, and then the area where the mariachi band played is directly behind the camera-taker.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC04019.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607121\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is one of our bridesmaids at the rooftop terrace right after the ceremony, but you can see how it overlooks onto the North Sky Terrace (we were on the other side, but it&#039;s the&amp;nbsp;same layout just flipped)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Hot tub background.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607125\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Cheers.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607127\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Walking up.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607131\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Walking up 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607134\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Nearly everyone ended up in the pool by the end of the night. : )&amp;nbsp; You can see the start of our tables to the right, and we also rented some lounge furniture from Zuniga (same decor place where the tiki torches came from.)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Pool bar.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607136\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1554689,"PostDate":1323255252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies!\u00a0 We just got back from BP, and we loved it!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> There were definitely a few little snafus along the way, but we're so happy with the overall way everything turned out.\u00a0 Here are some pictures....If you want to see more or have any specific questions that I can help with, let me know! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Welcome cocktail hour on the beach<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Welcome Cocktail Hour on the beach\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607111\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC03894.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607138\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Beautiful\u00a0rooms!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC03951.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607113\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Diamond wedding package set-up (but I think these are all being replaced by different packages : ()<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC03959.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607115\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We had a private function dinner at the South Sky Terrace (that and the north are the exact same set-up)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC03977.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607117\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Another angle, so you can see the side.\u00a0 FYI - the tiki torches were rented separately through the decor company.<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC03979.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607119\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Another angle....all of our tables are set up to the left, and then the area where the mariachi band played is directly behind the camera-taker.\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC04019.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607121\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is one of our bridesmaids at the rooftop terrace right after the ceremony, but you can see how it overlooks onto the North Sky Terrace (we were on the other side, but it's the\u00a0same layout just flipped)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Hot tub background.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607125\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Cheers.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607127\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Walking up.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607131\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Walking up 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607134\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Nearly everyone ended up in the pool by the end of the night. : )\u00a0 You can see the start of our tables to the right, and we also rented some lounge furniture from Zuniga (same decor place where the tiki torches came from.)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pool bar.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/607136\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarichristianson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295797984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235902.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saric83","Id":235902,"Name":"saric83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"388d70106d3fd5e5a38e7d6db9b4391d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks so much for the pics...I am hoping that you can help me....I am having a wedding at the Beach Palace on June 9th, 2012.&amp;nbsp; I am starting to be concerned with my reception venue.&amp;nbsp; We have booked the sky terrace for the ceremony and then the sky pool area for the cocktail and reception.&amp;nbsp; My concern is that from the pictures the space is not that big and we are thinking that we are going to have at least 60 people.&amp;nbsp; Do you think that there will be enough space with the tables and a big dance floor.&amp;nbsp; Its a party crowd so I am getting concerned that it will be very cramped with tables and a dance floor and will be hard for people to move around.&amp;nbsp; Thoughts????&amp;nbsp; Planning on using Zungia Productions for stuff like lounge furniture too (which I wanted in addition to the tables).&amp;nbsp; Probably like 3 lounge sets that seat about 10 per set up.&amp;nbsp; Also, can you tell me how the food was?&amp;nbsp; Which menu did you use??&amp;nbsp; Any and all info that you can provide would be sooo appreciated!&amp;nbsp; Your wedding looked like it was a blast and sooo pretty!&amp;nbsp; Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556804,"PostDate":1323807224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks so much for the pics...I am hoping that you can help me....I am having a wedding at the Beach Palace on June 9th, 2012.\u00a0 I am starting to be concerned with my reception venue.\u00a0 We have booked the sky terrace for the ceremony and then the sky pool area for the cocktail and reception.\u00a0 My concern is that from the pictures the space is not that big and we are thinking that we are going to have at least 60 people.\u00a0 Do you think that there will be enough space with the tables and a big dance floor.\u00a0 Its a party crowd so I am getting concerned that it will be very cramped with tables and a dance floor and will be hard for people to move around.\u00a0 Thoughts????\u00a0 Planning on using Zungia Productions for stuff like lounge furniture too (which I wanted in addition to the tables).\u00a0 Probably like 3 lounge sets that seat about 10 per set up.\u00a0 Also, can you tell me how the food was?\u00a0 Which menu did you use??\u00a0 Any and all info that you can provide would be sooo appreciated!\u00a0 Your wedding looked like it was a blast and sooo pretty!\u00a0 Congrats!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beachbums19a@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317682120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246193.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beachbums19a","Id":246193,"Name":"beachbums19a","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1973,"TotalPages":198,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":1970},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
