{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3616c9cb4e5aeb67e372b819fcca7ec5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; How exciting! : )&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We didn&#039;t do a separate cocktail hour (we did one the night before instead) and just had the dinner function set up for three and half hours.&amp;nbsp; So I&#039;m sure it&amp;nbsp;could work, but I&#039;m not sure how they set up additional furniture for the cocktail hour.&amp;nbsp; Maybe you could see if they could do the cocktail hour down on the beach or something (there will be an&amp;nbsp;additional $6 per person set up for the beach location), and then have the dinner up at the terrace?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We wanted all of our tables set up on one side of the pool&amp;nbsp;instead of 20 people on one side and 20 on the other since it felt weird without a dance floor in the middle, so you could get three tables set up on each side of the pool with the dance floor in the middle (below is a picture from another wedding I saw on here where they had a dance floor, so you can see how that looks.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Wedding Reception\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3247\" height=\"596\" src=\"http:\/\/photosincancun.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/06\/Beach-Palace-Wedding-16.jpg\" style=\"width: 474px; height: 272px;\" title=\"Beach Palace Wedding Packages\" width=\"900\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; But I would probably suggest going with smaller set-ups for the lounge stuff.&amp;nbsp; You could let them give you suggestions for what would fit amongst everything else since there might be some random little areas that could fit a lounge area for&amp;nbsp;four people&amp;nbsp;and then a couple for six&amp;nbsp;or whatever.&amp;nbsp; Larger sets of 10 might be a little too tight amongst all of the tables and the dance floor.&amp;nbsp; Another thing that was nice is that people obviously go up to the bar, so that&#039;s another full area that give people room to hang out.&amp;nbsp;If you haven&#039;t already done it, I would definitely recommend doing some kind of additional lighting through Zuniga.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s bright enough with the lighting up there, but it helps to give it softer light.&amp;nbsp; We went with 16 tiki torches, which we loved, but the lighting in the picture above with the dance floor looks so cool, and we saw a beach wedding with it too, and it looked great!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We went with the Mexican buffet since we figured that was the safest choice with appealing to a lot of people, and we really liked it!&amp;nbsp; It was different from what we had been eating all week (the only thing that was similar was the fajita meat, which was good : )), and a lot of people commented about how they loved it.&amp;nbsp; When we did the welcome cocktail hour the night before, we went with the International Hors d&#039;oeuvre menu, and they were really good too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We got our professional pictures back now, so here are a few more pictures where you can see the layout better.  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You can see the entire empty side where you could set more tables up.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384051_522683397748_162700365_30471139_1931866389_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/391070_522683712118_162700365_30471153_1507898392_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"638\" src=\"http:\/\/a7.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/374345_522770558078_162700365_30471756_557160023_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 838px; height: 588px;\" width=\"960\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We had four tables of 10.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a5.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-snc7\/387659_522683781978_162700365_30471156_2137209840_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a8.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384025_522682559428_162700365_30471107_1095640273_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You can see the buffet behind them, which was set up all along the back-side where the two terraces connect, so it was perfect and out of the way.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/381528_522682694158_162700365_30471112_514225376_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/378711_522682888768_162700365_30471119_568821409_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/390076_522683163218_162700365_30471129_1416412182_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Let me know if you have&amp;nbsp;ANY other questions I can help with!! : )&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1557741,"PostDate":1324062120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> How exciting! : )\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We didn't do a separate cocktail hour (we did one the night before instead) and just had the dinner function set up for three and half hours.\u00a0 So I'm sure it\u00a0could work, but I'm not sure how they set up additional furniture for the cocktail hour.\u00a0 Maybe you could see if they could do the cocktail hour down on the beach or something (there will be an\u00a0additional $6 per person set up for the beach location), and then have the dinner up at the terrace?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We wanted all of our tables set up on one side of the pool\u00a0instead of 20 people on one side and 20 on the other since it felt weird without a dance floor in the middle, so you could get three tables set up on each side of the pool with the dance floor in the middle (below is a picture from another wedding I saw on here where they had a dance floor, so you can see how that looks.)\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Wedding Reception\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3247\" height=\"596\" src=\"http:\/\/photosincancun.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/06\/Beach-Palace-Wedding-16.jpg\" style=\"width: 474px; height: 272px;\" title=\"Beach Palace Wedding Packages\" width=\"900\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But I would probably suggest going with smaller set-ups for the lounge stuff.\u00a0 You could let them give you suggestions for what would fit amongst everything else since there might be some random little areas that could fit a lounge area for\u00a0four people\u00a0and then a couple for six\u00a0or whatever.\u00a0 Larger sets of 10 might be a little too tight amongst all of the tables and the dance floor.\u00a0 Another thing that was nice is that people obviously go up to the bar, so that's another full area that give people room to hang out.\u00a0If you haven't already done it, I would definitely recommend doing some kind of additional lighting through Zuniga.\u00a0 It's bright enough with the lighting up there, but it helps to give it softer light.\u00a0 We went with 16 tiki torches, which we loved, but the lighting in the picture above with the dance floor looks so cool, and we saw a beach wedding with it too, and it looked great!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We went with the Mexican buffet since we figured that was the safest choice with appealing to a lot of people, and we really liked it!\u00a0 It was different from what we had been eating all week (the only thing that was similar was the fajita meat, which was good : )), and a lot of people commented about how they loved it.\u00a0 When we did the welcome cocktail hour the night before, we went with the International Hors d'oeuvre menu, and they were really good too.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We got our professional pictures back now, so here are a few more pictures where you can see the layout better.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You can see the entire empty side where you could set more tables up.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384051_522683397748_162700365_30471139_1931866389_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/391070_522683712118_162700365_30471153_1507898392_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"638\" src=\"http:\/\/a7.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/374345_522770558078_162700365_30471756_557160023_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 838px; height: 588px;\" width=\"960\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We had four tables of 10.<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a5.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-snc7\/387659_522683781978_162700365_30471156_2137209840_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a8.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384025_522682559428_162700365_30471107_1095640273_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You can see the buffet behind them, which was set up all along the back-side where the two terraces connect, so it was perfect and out of the way.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/381528_522682694158_162700365_30471112_514225376_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/378711_522682888768_162700365_30471119_568821409_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/390076_522683163218_162700365_30471129_1416412182_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Let me know if you have\u00a0ANY other questions I can help with!! : )<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarichristianson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295797984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235902.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saric83","Id":235902,"Name":"saric83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5561a5c3c05fc3938dec453bdc00872","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies....I too am getting married at Beach Palace...April 2012, can&#039;t wait! I found several sets of wedding pics just by goggling \"Beach Palace wedding pics\"!!! I LOVE the sky terrace, can&#039;t wait to get there....congrats to you all and happy planning!:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1557755,"PostDate":1324069768,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies....I too am getting married at Beach Palace...April 2012, can't wait! I found several sets of wedding pics just by goggling \"Beach Palace wedding pics\"!!! I LOVE the sky terrace, can't wait to get there....congrats to you all and happy planning!<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"n.terrell@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1303255519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/1\/15\/15885312_fb-user-612586624-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SOON2BDAVIS","Id":239068,"Name":"SOON2BDAVIS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b061240319b342ca65ccc0b54e42c588","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you for sharing all this great information.&amp;nbsp; We are getting married at at BP on the sky terrace Fe. 19th, 2012 which is right around the corner.&amp;nbsp; I still have so much to figure out!&amp;nbsp; From the sounds of it my Wedding Coordinator Janeesa was at your wedding also.&amp;nbsp; She said it was fabulous.&amp;nbsp; I am wondering if you hired a DJ and what you thought about that?&amp;nbsp; Looks like we have a very similar FUN group of people going and I want to make sure everyone has a great time, but the DJ at the resort is pretty spendy for 4 hours....although we are leaning that way so my groom can relax and not play DJ.&amp;nbsp; LOL&amp;nbsp; I really appreciate your advice!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1558942,"PostDate":1324467793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you for sharing all this great information.\u00a0 We are getting married at at BP on the sky terrace Fe. 19th, 2012 which is right around the corner.\u00a0 I still have so much to figure out!\u00a0 From the sounds of it my Wedding Coordinator Janeesa was at your wedding also.\u00a0 She said it was fabulous.\u00a0 I am wondering if you hired a DJ and what you thought about that?\u00a0 Looks like we have a very similar FUN group of people going and I want to make sure everyone has a great time, but the DJ at the resort is pretty spendy for 4 hours....although we are leaning that way so my groom can relax and not play DJ.\u00a0 LOL\u00a0 I really appreciate your advice!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christiejbrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1313851071,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244176.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChristieandTy","Id":244176,"Name":"ChristieandTy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b419de3718cc256d349bf1f399d22c34","RawContent":"Congrats! Your previous pictures look amazing- but I cannot view your professional pics, I don&#039;t know if it&#039;s just my computer that cannot view them or no one.  I would love to view your professional pics, if you have a link I can view! thanks! :)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]saric83[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n How exciting! : )  \n \n We didn&#039;t do a separate cocktail hour (we did one the night before instead) and just had the dinner function set up for three and half hours.  So I&#039;m sure it could work, but I&#039;m not sure how they set up additional furniture for the cocktail hour.  Maybe you could see if they could do the cocktail hour down on the beach or something (there will be an additional $6 per person set up for the beach location), and then have the dinner up at the terrace?  \n \n We wanted all of our tables set up on one side of the pool instead of 20 people on one side and 20 on the other since it felt weird without a dance floor in the middle, so you could get three tables set up on each side of the pool with the dance floor in the middle (below is a picture from another wedding I saw on here where they had a dance floor, so you can see how that looks.)  \n [img]http:\/\/photosincancun.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/06\/Beach-Palace-Wedding-16.jpg[\/img] \n \n But I would probably suggest going with smaller set-ups for the lounge stuff.  You could let them give you suggestions for what would fit amongst everything else since there might be some random little areas that could fit a lounge area for four people and then a couple for six or whatever.  Larger sets of 10 might be a little too tight amongst all of the tables and the dance floor.  Another thing that was nice is that people obviously go up to the bar, so that&#039;s another full area that give people room to hang out. If you haven&#039;t already done it, I would definitely recommend doing some kind of additional lighting through Zuniga.  It&#039;s bright enough with the lighting up there, but it helps to give it softer light.  We went with 16 tiki torches, which we loved, but the lighting in the picture above with the dance floor looks so cool, and we saw a beach wedding with it too, and it looked great! \n \n We went with the Mexican buffet since we figured that was the safest choice with appealing to a lot of people, and we really liked it!  It was different from what we had been eating all week (the only thing that was similar was the fajita meat, which was good : )), and a lot of people commented about how they loved it.  When we did the welcome cocktail hour the night before, we went with the International Hors d&#039;oeuvre menu, and they were really good too.  \n \n We got our professional pictures back now, so here are a few more pictures where you can see the layout better.   \n \n You can see the entire empty side where you could set more tables up. \n \n [img]http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384051_522683397748_162700365_30471139_1931866389_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/391070_522683712118_162700365_30471153_1507898392_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/a7.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/374345_522770558078_162700365_30471756_557160023_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n We had four tables of 10. \n [img]http:\/\/a5.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-snc7\/387659_522683781978_162700365_30471156_2137209840_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/a8.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384025_522682559428_162700365_30471107_1095640273_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n You can see the buffet behind them, which was set up all along the back-side where the two terraces connect, so it was perfect and out of the way. \n \n [img]http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/381528_522682694158_162700365_30471112_514225376_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/378711_522682888768_162700365_30471119_568821409_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/390076_522683163218_162700365_30471129_1416412182_n.jpg[\/img] \n \n Let me know if you have ANY other questions I can help with!! : ) \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1559005,"PostDate":1324475740,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Congrats! Your previous pictures look amazing- but I cannot view your professional pics, I don't know if it's just my computer that cannot view them or no one.\u00a0 I would love to view your professional pics, if you have a link I can view! thanks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>saric83<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> How exciting! : )\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We didn't do a separate cocktail hour (we did one the night before instead) and just had the dinner function set up for three and half hours.\u00a0 So I'm sure it\u00a0could work, but I'm not sure how they set up additional furniture for the cocktail hour.\u00a0 Maybe you could see if they could do the cocktail hour down on the beach or something (there will be an\u00a0additional $6 per person set up for the beach location), and then have the dinner up at the terrace?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We wanted all of our tables set up on one side of the pool\u00a0instead of 20 people on one side and 20 on the other since it felt weird without a dance floor in the middle, so you could get three tables set up on each side of the pool with the dance floor in the middle (below is a picture from another wedding I saw on here where they had a dance floor, so you can see how that looks.)\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Wedding Reception\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3247\" height=\"596\" src=\"http:\/\/photosincancun.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/06\/Beach-Palace-Wedding-16.jpg\" style=\"width: 474px; height: 272px\" title=\"Beach Palace Wedding Packages\" width=\"900\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But I would probably suggest going with smaller set-ups for the lounge stuff.\u00a0 You could let them give you suggestions for what would fit amongst everything else since there might be some random little areas that could fit a lounge area for\u00a0four people\u00a0and then a couple for six\u00a0or whatever.\u00a0 Larger sets of 10 might be a little too tight amongst all of the tables and the dance floor.\u00a0 Another thing that was nice is that people obviously go up to the bar, so that's another full area that give people room to hang out.\u00a0If you haven't already done it, I would definitely recommend doing some kind of additional lighting through Zuniga.\u00a0 It's bright enough with the lighting up there, but it helps to give it softer light.\u00a0 We went with 16 tiki torches, which we loved, but the lighting in the picture above with the dance floor looks so cool, and we saw a beach wedding with it too, and it looked great!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We went with the Mexican buffet since we figured that was the safest choice with appealing to a lot of people, and we really liked it!\u00a0 It was different from what we had been eating all week (the only thing that was similar was the fajita meat, which was good : )), and a lot of people commented about how they loved it.\u00a0 When we did the welcome cocktail hour the night before, we went with the International Hors d'oeuvre menu, and they were really good too.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We got our professional pictures back now, so here are a few more pictures where you can see the layout better.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You can see the entire empty side where you could set more tables up.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384051_522683397748_162700365_30471139_1931866389_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/391070_522683712118_162700365_30471153_1507898392_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"638\" src=\"http:\/\/a7.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/374345_522770558078_162700365_30471756_557160023_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 838px; height: 588px\" width=\"960\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We had four tables of 10.<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a5.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-snc7\/387659_522683781978_162700365_30471156_2137209840_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a8.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/384025_522682559428_162700365_30471107_1095640273_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You can see the buffet behind them, which was set up all along the back-side where the two terraces connect, so it was perfect and out of the way.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/381528_522682694158_162700365_30471112_514225376_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/378711_522682888768_162700365_30471119_568821409_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"fbPhotosSnowboxCaption\" class=\"spotlight\" height=\"531\" src=\"http:\/\/a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash4\/390076_522683163218_162700365_30471129_1416412182_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Let me know if you have\u00a0ANY other questions I can help with!! : )<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294235074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ce596fa90d522c5e4c11abe35f1c88d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks! :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We actually decided not to go with the DJ, so, unfortunately, I&#039;m no help there.&amp;nbsp; We hired the mariachi band for the first 45 minutes, which lots of people danced to.&amp;nbsp; And then we just had our iPod playing in a docking station, and we just had lots of old-school&amp;nbsp;laid-back&amp;nbsp;music.&amp;nbsp; Then after we jumped in the pool and all needed showers,&amp;nbsp;those who wanted to dance&amp;nbsp;changed and headed out to karokee night at one of the bars in the hotel, and then we went out to Margaritaville.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1559281,"PostDate":1324549665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We actually decided not to go with the DJ, so, unfortunately, I'm no help there.\u00a0 We hired the mariachi band for the first 45 minutes, which lots of people danced to.\u00a0 And then we just had our iPod playing in a docking station, and we just had lots of old-school\u00a0laid-back\u00a0music.\u00a0 Then after we jumped in the pool and all needed showers,\u00a0those who wanted to dance\u00a0changed and headed out to karokee night at one of the bars in the hotel, and then we went out to Margaritaville.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarichristianson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295797984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235902.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saric83","Id":235902,"Name":"saric83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"926cc6c5c7a6dbc2061a6b2cc3903541","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; @ Shan - We actually don&#039;t have them up on a link since we got the rights to the pictures and just have them all on a CD.&amp;nbsp; But shoot me an email, and I can definitely send them to you.&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:sarichristianson@gmail.com\"&gt;sarichristianson@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1559282,"PostDate":1324549763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> @ Shan - We actually don't have them up on a link since we got the rights to the pictures and just have them all on a CD.\u00a0 But shoot me an email, and I can definitely send them to you.\u00a0 <a href='mailto:sarichristianson@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>sarichristianson@gmail.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarichristianson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295797984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235902.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saric83","Id":235902,"Name":"saric83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b54be086a0845af381c1d5815ee880b4","RawContent":"Awesome! Thank you- I&#039;ll email you when I get home! :)\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]saric83[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n @ Shan - We actually don&#039;t have them up on a link since we got the rights to the pictures and just have them all on a CD.  But shoot me an email, and I can definitely send them to you.  [email=\"sarichristianson@gmail.com\"]sarichristianson@gmail.com[\/email][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1559395,"PostDate":1324562727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Awesome! Thank you- I'll email you when I get home! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>saric83<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> @ Shan - We actually don't have them up on a link since we got the rights to the pictures and just have them all on a CD.\u00a0 But shoot me an email, and I can definitely send them to you.\u00a0 <a href='mailto:sarichristianson@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>sarichristianson@gmail.com<\/a><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294235074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5a7ff02f846d229ae6f0a67d0e6713b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sound like MY kinda party! Hoping mine is as laid back and fun!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1559598,"PostDate":1324634844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sound like MY kinda party! Hoping mine is as laid back and fun!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lucyperry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1320495970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247395.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LPerry","Id":247395,"Name":"LPerry","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85910f92c910945c91348bc7bd2be998","RawContent":"Saric, \n I had a question about the officiant you had at the ceremony. How were they? Did you have a special request eg. sand ceremony?\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]saric83[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks! :) \n \n We actually decided not to go with the DJ, so, unfortunately, I&#039;m no help there.  We hired the mariachi band for the first 45 minutes, which lots of people danced to.  And then we just had our iPod playing in a docking station, and we just had lots of old-school laid-back music.  Then after we jumped in the pool and all needed showers, those who wanted to dance changed and headed out to karokee night at one of the bars in the hotel, and then we went out to Margaritaville.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1559934,"PostDate":1324823544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Saric,<\/p> <p> I had a question about the officiant you had at the ceremony. How were they? Did you have a special request eg. sand ceremony?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>saric83<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We actually decided not to go with the DJ, so, unfortunately, I'm no help there.\u00a0 We hired the mariachi band for the first 45 minutes, which lots of people danced to.\u00a0 And then we just had our iPod playing in a docking station, and we just had lots of old-school\u00a0laid-back\u00a0music.\u00a0 Then after we jumped in the pool and all needed showers,\u00a0those who wanted to dance\u00a0changed and headed out to karokee night at one of the bars in the hotel, and then we went out to Margaritaville.\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mz_priya@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"108.173.31.172","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313499312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243976.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mizpriya","Id":243976,"Name":"mizpriya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61e2f7aa36063fa49356d7141e1a96d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; He was great!! I didn&#039;t get a chance to talk with him before the ceremony, but H did, and he really liked him.&amp;nbsp; He had a really smoothing and loud voice, so it was absolutely perfect.&amp;nbsp; We didn&#039;t do a sand ceremony or anything, but he did as H if he wanted to add a Mayan prayer\/blessing, which we both loved.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1560094,"PostDate":1324931661,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> He was great!! I didn't get a chance to talk with him before the ceremony, but H did, and he really liked him.\u00a0 He had a really smoothing and loud voice, so it was absolutely perfect.\u00a0 We didn't do a sand ceremony or anything, but he did as H if he wanted to add a Mayan prayer\/blessing, which we both loved.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarichristianson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295797984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235902.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saric83","Id":235902,"Name":"saric83","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1973,"TotalPages":198,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":1970},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
