{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cba0c4331afc690688910125e6a9873","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello ladies I&#039;m planning my wedding at Beach palace for May 2013 I&#039;m wondering if there is anyone that has gotten married on the beach rather than the rooftop terrace? I&#039;m looking at one of the new packages called Lavender Luxe and I would love to see some pictures of a wedding on the beach. Thanks for your help! Also, how much was the reception on the rooftop terrace?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1564239,"PostDate":1325768641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello ladies I'm planning my wedding at Beach palace for May 2013 I'm wondering if there is anyone that has gotten married on the beach rather than the rooftop terrace? I'm looking at one of the new packages called Lavender Luxe and I would love to see some pictures of a wedding on the beach. Thanks for your help! Also, how much was the reception on the rooftop terrace?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wolynski_julia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.199.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325768467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249399.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julia14","Id":249399,"Name":"Julia14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc10c5e6e1d2b86128cfbda442879e48","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are putting together our webinar schedule for BDW. &amp;nbsp;T&lt;span style=\"background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; \"&gt;hese webinars are great because not only can you get YOUR questions answered but also hear answers to questions from other brides that you may not have even though of :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; Webinars are a great way to not only hear directly from the wedding department but see the wedding packages that they offer, ceremony\/reception pics, etc.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; I try to only limit the webinars to once every 2 weeks so we of course can not do all resorts.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; Please vote on which resorts you would like to have webinars on...you can choose more than 1.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/77383\/what-resort-webinars-would-you-like-to-see-on-bdw\"&gt;Vote for your Resort Webinar HERE&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1564258,"PostDate":1325770464,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hey Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are putting together our webinar schedule for BDW. \u00a0T<span  style=\"background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto\">hese webinars are great because not only can you get YOUR questions answered but also hear answers to questions from other brides that you may not have even though of <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> Webinars are a great way to not only hear directly from the wedding department but see the wedding packages that they offer, ceremony\/reception pics, etc.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> I try to only limit the webinars to once every 2 weeks so we of course can not do all resorts.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> Please vote on which resorts you would like to have webinars on...you can choose more than 1.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> <strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/77383\/what-resort-webinars-would-you-like-to-see-on-bdw' class='bbc_url' title=''>Vote for your Resort Webinar HERE<\/a><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137199020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce31e9582296e2cfcffaa2436f4cfc68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey all.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was looking around for pictures of weddings at Beach Palace and came across this one. Just looking at the pictures is getting me excited for us to have our wedding there! Hope all works out for us *fingers crossed*!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is the link: http:\/\/www.fineartstudioblog.com\/ashley-dean-beach-palace-resort-cancun-destination-wedding-photography\/&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570630,"PostDate":1327005350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey all.<\/p> <p> I was looking around for pictures of weddings at Beach Palace and came across this one. Just looking at the pictures is getting me excited for us to have our wedding there! Hope all works out for us *fingers crossed*!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is the link: <a href='http:\/\/www.fineartstudioblog.com\/ashley-dean-beach-palace-resort-cancun-destination-wedding-photography\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.fineartst...ng-photography\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Enjoy!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mz_priya@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"108.173.31.172","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313499312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243976.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mizpriya","Id":243976,"Name":"mizpriya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cabad15d8a48c6bd1dd3d2e1fc2579c","RawContent":"SO glad you found this! I agree...seeing these make me so excited for our wedding at Beach Palace in July!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mizpriya[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey all. \n I was looking around for pictures of weddings at Beach Palace and came across this one. Just looking at the pictures is getting me excited for us to have our wedding there! Hope all works out for us *fingers crossed*!!! \n \n Here is the link: [url=\"http:\/\/www.fineartstudioblog.com\/ashley-dean-beach-palace-resort-cancun-destination-wedding-photography\/\"]http:\/\/www.fineartstudioblog.com\/ashley-dean-beach-palace-resort-cancun-destination-wedding-photography\/[\/url] \n \n Enjoy![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1571760,"PostDate":1327257089,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> SO glad you found this! I agree...seeing these make me so excited for our wedding at Beach Palace in July!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mizpriya<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey all.<\/p> <p> I was looking around for pictures of weddings at Beach Palace and came across this one. Just looking at the pictures is getting me excited for us to have our wedding there! Hope all works out for us *fingers crossed*!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is the link: <a href='http:\/\/www.fineartstudioblog.com\/ashley-dean-beach-palace-resort-cancun-destination-wedding-photography\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.fineartst...ng-photography\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Enjoy!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lucyperry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1320495970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247395.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LPerry","Id":247395,"Name":"LPerry","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d38b8a14ff1ce0f52facb02ff7569582","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I recently had my wedding at BP January, 15 2012. If you have any questions feel free to ask or email me: kdr7798@gmail.com. &lt;span style=\"font-style: italic;\"&gt;I was married rooftop, and had my ceremony in the ballroom. I know how hard it was to find information and pictures on here for BP so any information I can provide you with I will, as far as the resort itself, outside vendors I used and loved, BP vendors I used and hated, etc. I also have tons of pictures but am unsure how to post on here. I will do my best to figure it out. Any questions though, feel free to ask!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-style: italic;\"&gt;KELLY&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571882,"PostDate":1327303928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I recently had my wedding at BP January, 15 2012. If you have any questions feel free to ask or email me: kdr7798@gmail.com. <span  style=\"font-style: italic\">I was married rooftop, and had my ceremony in the ballroom. I know how hard it was to find information and pictures on here for BP so any information I can provide you with I will, as far as the resort itself, outside vendors I used and loved, BP vendors I used and hated, etc. I also have tons of pictures but am unsure how to post on here. I will do my best to figure it out. Any questions though, feel free to ask!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-style: italic\">KELLY<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdr7798@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295613556,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235816.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kd1116","Id":235816,"Name":"kd1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36866ddd4a38c314b2c017131df51f62","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am getting married December 5th 2012, and would like to know more about the costs of the reception regarding food and drinks. Are they included if we have a large group and have free unlimited private functions? &amp;nbsp;Also has anyone seen a list of the options for food? &amp;nbsp;What about options for having a longer reception on the sky terrace? I have heard that they limit you to 2 hours?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"myEventWatcherDiv\" style=\"display:none;\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572173,"PostDate":1327340473,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am getting married December 5th 2012, and would like to know more about the costs of the reception regarding food and drinks. Are they included if we have a large group and have free unlimited private functions? \u00a0Also has anyone seen a list of the options for food? \u00a0What about options for having a longer reception on the sky terrace? I have heard that they limit you to 2 hours?<\/p> <div id=\"myEventWatcherDiv\"  style=\"display:none\"> \u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamesnkalie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326710749,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249983.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JKWedding2012","Id":249983,"Name":"JKWedding2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5dd3611c2684a5f4b8a14c7e5b593434","RawContent":"that would be awesome! i will be keeping you in mind Kelly~ thank you!! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kd1116[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies, \n \n I recently had my wedding at BP January, 15 2012. If you have any questions feel free to ask or email me: kdr7798@gmail.com. [i]I was married rooftop, and had my ceremony in the ballroom. I know how hard it was to find information and pictures on here for BP so any information I can provide you with I will, as far as the resort itself, outside vendors I used and loved, BP vendors I used and hated, etc. I also have tons of pictures but am unsure how to post on here. I will do my best to figure it out. Any questions though, feel free to ask![\/i] \n \n [i]KELLY[\/i][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1573077,"PostDate":1327493782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> that would be awesome! i will be keeping you in mind Kelly~ thank you!!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kd1116<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I recently had my wedding at BP January, 15 2012. If you have any questions feel free to ask or email me: kdr7798@gmail.com. <span  style=\"font-style: italic\">I was married rooftop, and had my ceremony in the ballroom. I know how hard it was to find information and pictures on here for BP so any information I can provide you with I will, as far as the resort itself, outside vendors I used and loved, BP vendors I used and hated, etc. I also have tons of pictures but am unsure how to post on here. I will do my best to figure it out. Any questions though, feel free to ask!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-style: italic\">KELLY<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mz_priya@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"108.173.31.172","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313499312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243976.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mizpriya","Id":243976,"Name":"mizpriya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc9d5def3e5d7301e6b8ddbd5ff5a17f","RawContent":"oh and CONGRATULATIONS!!!! \n \n lol \n \n I&#039;m so rude!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kd1116[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies, \n \n I recently had my wedding at BP January, 15 2012. If you have any questions feel free to ask or email me: kdr7798@gmail.com. [i]I was married rooftop, and had my ceremony in the ballroom. I know how hard it was to find information and pictures on here for BP so any information I can provide you with I will, as far as the resort itself, outside vendors I used and loved, BP vendors I used and hated, etc. I also have tons of pictures but am unsure how to post on here. I will do my best to figure it out. Any questions though, feel free to ask![\/i] \n \n [i]KELLY[\/i][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1573080,"PostDate":1327493823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> oh and CONGRATULATIONS!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm so rude!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kd1116<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I recently had my wedding at BP January, 15 2012. If you have any questions feel free to ask or email me: kdr7798@gmail.com. <span  style=\"font-style: italic\">I was married rooftop, and had my ceremony in the ballroom. I know how hard it was to find information and pictures on here for BP so any information I can provide you with I will, as far as the resort itself, outside vendors I used and loved, BP vendors I used and hated, etc. I also have tons of pictures but am unsure how to post on here. I will do my best to figure it out. Any questions though, feel free to ask!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-style: italic\">KELLY<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mz_priya@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"108.173.31.172","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313499312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243976.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mizpriya","Id":243976,"Name":"mizpriya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acba22ed221ab54754faa3c776f92879","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"post-user-avatar\"&gt; &lt;a class=\"thumb\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/49801\/julia14\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"80\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d2\/80x80px-LS-d272ccb8_avatar-170-9.jpg\" width=\"80\" \/&gt; &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;ul class=\"post-user-info\"&gt; &lt;!-- FIXME: needs styling from \"post-user-info\" --&gt; &lt;li class=\"post-username\"&gt; &lt;span class=\"pmenuShow HM-user-menu\" id=\"pMenu-49801\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/49801\/julia14\"&gt;Julia14 &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li class=\"post-trader-feedback\"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/classifieds\/feedback\/index\/user_id\/49801\"&gt;Trader Feedback:&lt;\/a&gt; &lt;a class=\"ilink neutral\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/classifieds\/feedback\/index\/user_id\/49801\"&gt;0&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span class=\"user-badge-vert\"&gt;&lt;img class=\"user-badge-vert\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/custom\/huddle\/bestdestinationwedding\/img\/badges\/badge_noob.v1305918898.png\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li class=\"bannedBadge-49801\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li class=\"post-offline\"&gt; &lt;span class=\"offline itext\" title=\"\"&gt;offline&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;ul class=\"post-user-stats\"&gt; &lt;li&gt; 2 Posts. Joined 1\/2012&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li class=\"select-all-posts\"&gt; &lt;a class=\"H-forumMod-selector-allUser\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75880\/beach-palace-cancun-brides\/40#\"&gt;Select All Posts By This User&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;div class=\"post-content-area indexable\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"shazam wiki_markup \" id=\"content_1713807\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hello ladies I&#039;m planning my wedding at Beach palace for May 2013 I&#039;m wondering if there is anyone that has gotten married on the beach rather than the rooftop terrace? I&#039;m looking at one of the new packages called Lavender Luxe and I would love to see some pictures of a wedding on the beach. Thanks for your help! Also, how much was the reception on the rooftop terrace?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Julia14...I am also planning on a may 2013 wedding at beach palace..just wondering what your date was.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573667,"PostDate":1327578928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"post-user-avatar\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/49801\/julia14' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"80\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d2\/80x80px-LS-d272ccb8_avatar-170-9.jpg\" width=\"80\" \/><\/span> <\/a><\/div> <ul class=\"post-user-info\"> <!-- FIXME: needs styling from \"post-user-info\" --> <li class=\"post-username\"> <span class=\"pmenuShow HM-user-menu\" id=\"pMenu-49801\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/u\/49801\/julia14' class='bbc_url' title=''>Julia14 <\/a><\/span><\/li> <li class=\"post-trader-feedback\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/classifieds\/feedback\/index\/user_id\/49801' class='bbc_url' title=''>Trader Feedback:<\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/classifieds\/feedback\/index\/user_id\/49801' class='bbc_url' title=''>0<\/a><\/li> <li> <span class=\"user-badge-vert\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"user-badge-vert\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/custom\/huddle\/bestdestinationwedding\/img\/badges\/badge_noob.v1305918898.png\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/li> <li class=\"bannedBadge-49801\"> \u00a0<\/li> <li class=\"post-offline\"> <span class=\"offline itext\" title=\"\">offline<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <ul class=\"post-user-stats\"> <li> 2 Posts. Joined 1\/2012<\/li> <li class=\"select-all-posts\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75880\/beach-palace-cancun-brides\/40#' class='bbc_url' title=''>Select All Posts By This User<\/a><\/li> <\/ul> <div class=\"post-content-area indexable\"> <div class=\"shazam wiki_markup \" id=\"content_1713807\"> <p> Hello ladies I'm planning my wedding at Beach palace for May 2013 I'm wondering if there is anyone that has gotten married on the beach rather than the rooftop terrace? I'm looking at one of the new packages called Lavender Luxe and I would love to see some pictures of a wedding on the beach. Thanks for your help! Also, how much was the reception on the rooftop terrace?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Julia14...I am also planning on a may 2013 wedding at beach palace..just wondering what your date was.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdkotyla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323352758,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248465.bmp?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kdkotyla619","Id":248465,"Name":"kdkotyla619","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7d52d839a26daaf8c95eaea22e59bc5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve never heard of anyone having free unlimited private functions, so I&#039;m not sure exactly what that entails, but I&#039;ve definitely heard of a lot of brides getting free cocktail hours or even free dinners based on the number of rooms booked.&amp;nbsp; We earned a free cocktail hour, but we used it as a welcome cocktail hour the night before the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Prices may have changed for 2012 (we just got married in December), but the private function for dinner and drinks was $400 per table of 10, which I thought was for two hours, but they actually said three once we got there.&amp;nbsp; If you want an additional hour, it was $200 per table of 10.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We did the buffet option, and I don&#039;t remember all of the different ones, but I think we had eight or nine&amp;nbsp;different ones to choose from including a Yucatan menu, Mexican menu, International menu, and I think there was an Italian one too, etc....&amp;nbsp; We went with a classic Mexican one, and it was awesome!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573907,"PostDate":1327603036,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've never heard of anyone having free unlimited private functions, so I'm not sure exactly what that entails, but I've definitely heard of a lot of brides getting free cocktail hours or even free dinners based on the number of rooms booked.\u00a0 We earned a free cocktail hour, but we used it as a welcome cocktail hour the night before the wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Prices may have changed for 2012 (we just got married in December), but the private function for dinner and drinks was $400 per table of 10, which I thought was for two hours, but they actually said three once we got there.\u00a0 If you want an additional hour, it was $200 per table of 10.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We did the buffet option, and I don't remember all of the different ones, but I think we had eight or nine\u00a0different ones to choose from including a Yucatan menu, Mexican menu, International menu, and I think there was an Italian one too, etc....\u00a0 We went with a classic Mexican one, and it was awesome!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarichristianson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295797984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235902.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saric83","Id":235902,"Name":"saric83","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1973,"TotalPages":198,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":1970},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
