style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395321414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.43.138.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbd1382d4f05a64891c9337fcb56c96c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Awesome!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865902,"PostDate":1407849512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Awesome!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ctlind7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"143.43.138.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375447213,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272185.jpg?_r=1407873310","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ctlind7","Id":272185,"Name":"ctlind7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1407870271,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b74cde8f50492f544e6cf4b72194d7fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks ladies!&amp;nbsp; I have an obsessive personality haha.&amp;nbsp; I just hope it all turns out&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got the groomsmen and ring bearer bow ties and suspenders in the mail!&amp;nbsp; They look great! These are from Etsy Sweetnswag - they were one of the cheapest I found there (about $15 a set)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s30.postimg.org\/qmnbi26dt\/Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_51_51_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_51_51_PM.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are the groomsmen ones from The Grunion Shop.&amp;nbsp; Came super quickly from California. Just have to get a plain black one for my FI now :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/ilpq7qnoz\/IMG_5827.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5827.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m debating centrepieces now... thinking of getting low ones through Maya floral because it&#039;ll be cheaper for Marvin to drop them off in the lobby.&amp;nbsp; I really wanted the high ones, but I think it&#039;d be quite a bit more.&amp;nbsp; The hotel still hasn&#039;t gotten back to me with proper quotes either :S.&amp;nbsp; Looking at one of these, but more in our colours - blush and fuschia pink, coral, creams, hint of orange?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/imhai3gjh\/Screen_Shot_2014_08_08_at_2_36_41_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2014_08_08_at_2_36_41_PM.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also trying to figure out how I could incorporate the centerpieces into the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; Zuniga has these pedestals I can rent for $30 a piece which is 1 option but would add up quickly.&amp;nbsp; Maybe just 2 at the alter?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s18.postimg.org\/yrye8o2q1\/Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_56_08_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_56_08_PM.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865961,"PostDate":1407870012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks ladies!\u00a0 I have an obsessive personality haha.\u00a0 I just hope it all turns out<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got the groomsmen and ring bearer bow ties and suspenders in the mail!\u00a0 They look great! These are from Etsy Sweetnswag - they were one of the cheapest I found there (about $15 a set)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s30.postimg.org\/qmnbi26dt\/Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_51_51_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_51_51_PM.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are the groomsmen ones from The Grunion Shop.\u00a0 Came super quickly from California. Just have to get a plain black one for my FI now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/ilpq7qnoz\/IMG_5827.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5827.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm debating centrepieces now... thinking of getting low ones through Maya floral because it'll be cheaper for Marvin to drop them off in the lobby.\u00a0 I really wanted the high ones, but I think it'd be quite a bit more.\u00a0 The hotel still hasn't gotten back to me with proper quotes either :S.\u00a0 Looking at one of these, but more in our colours - blush and fuschia pink, coral, creams, hint of orange?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/imhai3gjh\/Screen_Shot_2014_08_08_at_2_36_41_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2014_08_08_at_2_36_41_PM.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also trying to figure out how I could incorporate the centerpieces into the ceremony.\u00a0 Zuniga has these pedestals I can rent for $30 a piece which is 1 option but would add up quickly.\u00a0 Maybe just 2 at the alter?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s18.postimg.org\/yrye8o2q1\/Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_56_08_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2014_08_12_at_9_56_08_PM.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.145.240.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81a3d317679da8f228e90376d2094dbe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I agree with maybe 2 at the alter. &amp;nbsp;Those are pretty big pillars, then a large flower on top my fear is you may block the view of some of the guests.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866008,"PostDate":1407909585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I agree with maybe 2 at the alter. \u00a0Those are pretty big pillars, then a large flower on top my fear is you may block the view of some of the guests.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":304,"TotalPages":31,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":300},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
