{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.112.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f14a93916cc3d98fe082e46d3c75cbc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nadiakat17\"] - I&#039;m getting them in December!&amp;nbsp; If you go to her website Bloom Bridal, or her facebook page (same name), you can see examples of all the bouquets she&#039;s done&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866427,"PostDate":1408030064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279229\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279229-nadiakat17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nadiakat17<\/span><\/a> - I'm getting them in December!\u00a0 If you go to her website Bloom Bridal, or her facebook page (same name), you can see examples of all the bouquets she's done<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.53.109.189","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61dd87285dbda19892c7c477853c268a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love the dress you picked out for a potential TTD or reception dress. Who designed it\/what&#039;s the style name because I am in love!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you decide to have it made?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867791,"PostDate":1408484023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love the dress you picked out for a potential TTD or reception dress. Who designed it\/what's the style name because I am in love!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you decide to have it made?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mckiever.whetsel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.53.109.189","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1377346814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272881.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mckievme","Id":272881,"Name":"mckievme","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.18.213.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6494faf968b983686d1d7d12e549199","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Looks great!! and I have to say a big thank you, we were looking for suspenders for the groomsmen and couldn&#039;t find anything we like up here and thanks to you, that website is going to be a big help! Really appreciate it :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867822,"PostDate":1408522034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Looks great!! and I have to say a big thank you, we were looking for suspenders for the groomsmen and couldn't find anything we like up here and thanks to you, that website is going to be a big help! Really appreciate it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304947091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1434572414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.112.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b385604e9e2be1d4d50d0e25237b16d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mckievme\" post=\"1867791\" timestamp=\"1408509223\"]\nI love the dress you picked out for a potential TTD or reception dress. Who designed it\/what&#039;s the style name because I am in love!\n\nDid you decide to have it made?[\/quote]\nI&#039;m going to have it made, I&#039;ve just been putting it off haha.  But thanks for reminding me - I will get on it now\n\nIt&#039;s by Truvelle - she&#039;s an independent Canadian designer.  The dress is called Julia\n\n[quote name=\"Mrsktobe\" post=\"1867822\" timestamp=\"1408547234\"]\nLooks great!! and I have to say a big thank you, we were looking for suspenders for the groomsmen and couldn&#039;t find anything we like up here and thanks to you, that website is going to be a big help! Really appreciate it :)[\/quote]\nNo problem! They arrived super fast in the mail and the shipping to Canada wasn&#039;t too bad","Attachments":[],"Id":1867824,"PostDate":1408522191,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>mckievme, on 19 August 2014 - 09:33 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I love the dress you picked out for a potential TTD or reception dress. Who designed it\/what's the style name because I am in love!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you decide to have it made?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm going to have it made, I've just been putting it off haha.\u00a0 But thanks for reminding me - I will get on it now<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's by Truvelle - she's an independent Canadian designer.\u00a0 The dress is called Julia<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mrsktobe, on 20 August 2014 - 08:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Looks great!! and I have to say a big thank you, we were looking for suspenders for the groomsmen and couldn't find anything we like up here and thanks to you, that website is going to be a big help! Really appreciate it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>No problem! They arrived super fast in the mail and the shipping to Canada wasn't too bad<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.126.19.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0421b22fb9ac02a1cfe7b64492bfea5","RawContent":"Please let us know all the details. \n\n\nI&#039;ve been wanting a TTD dress and I&#039;m in love with this one! I just may have to copy you :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1867830,"PostDate":1408525477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Please let us know all the details. <br><br>\nI've been wanting a TTD dress and I'm in love with this one! I just may have to copy you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mckiever.whetsel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.53.109.189","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1377346814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272881.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mckievme","Id":272881,"Name":"mckievme","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.112.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a8eaac35f609ff695ba0e087ba16ea5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mckievme\"] - It&#039;s a beautiful dress - go for it! That&#039;s what I&#039;m hoping to use it for too :).&amp;nbsp; I will definitely let you know, and how it holds up in the water&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867831,"PostDate":1408526155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272881\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272881-mckievme\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mckievme<\/span><\/a> - It's a beautiful dress - go for it! That's what I'm hoping to use it for too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0 I will definitely let you know, and how it holds up in the water<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":8,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94c859ea5d6c6e1165574b1b1b12fd44","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We had our Vietnamese\/Chinese engagement party and tea ceremony on Saturday, and I wanted to share some pics with you ladies! In my culture, these are both big events.&amp;nbsp; The engagement party is when the bride and groom become officially engaged and accepted by the family.&amp;nbsp; The groom&#039;s family brings a lot of gifts to the bride&#039;s family like money, tea, wine, cakes and cookies, fruit and a big roast pig. The tea ceremony is usually done the day of the wedding, and in my culture, this is almost like the actual wedding.&amp;nbsp; For them, exchanging vows is nice to watch, but the serving of the tea and acceptance into the family is when the couple actually becomes \"married.\" So to my family at least, we&#039;re pretty much married ;).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We decided to combine both of these 2 events into one big day so my grandparents who can&#039;t come to Mexico could celebrate with us.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m wearing a Chinese style qi pao, and you&#039;ll see some of my family members in the Vietnamese ao dai. I&#039;m half Chinese and half Vietnamese, so we tend to have traditions from both cultures. My FI&#039;s family is Korean, and we encouraged his mom to wear a traditional Korean dress - a hanbook.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/6flbirb1f\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/wix0ktjjf\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s1.postimg.org\/8q626zczz\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s13.postimg.org\/56mz07y1z\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s17.postimg.org\/l6ydud3bj\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868144,"PostDate":1408653324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We had our Vietnamese\/Chinese engagement party and tea ceremony on Saturday, and I wanted to share some pics with you ladies! In my culture, these are both big events.\u00a0 The engagement party is when the bride and groom become officially engaged and accepted by the family.\u00a0 The groom's family brings a lot of gifts to the bride's family like money, tea, wine, cakes and cookies, fruit and a big roast pig. The tea ceremony is usually done the day of the wedding, and in my culture, this is almost like the actual wedding.\u00a0 For them, exchanging vows is nice to watch, but the serving of the tea and acceptance into the family is when the couple actually becomes \"married.\" So to my family at least, we're pretty much married <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We decided to combine both of these 2 events into one big day so my grandparents who can't come to Mexico could celebrate with us.\u00a0 I'm wearing a Chinese style qi pao, and you'll see some of my family members in the Vietnamese ao dai. I'm half Chinese and half Vietnamese, so we tend to have traditions from both cultures. My FI's family is Korean, and we encouraged his mom to wear a traditional Korean dress - a hanbook.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/6flbirb1f\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/wix0ktjjf\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s1.postimg.org\/8q626zczz\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s13.postimg.org\/56mz07y1z\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s17.postimg.org\/l6ydud3bj\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55d82c4a321e1580787a9bf4309c115d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1868144\" timestamp=\"1408678524\"]\nWe had our Vietnamese\/Chinese engagement party and tea ceremony on Saturday, and I wanted to share some pics with you ladies! In my culture, these are both big events.  The engagement party is when the bride and groom become officially engaged and accepted by the family.  The groom&#039;s family brings a lot of gifts to the bride&#039;s family like money, tea, wine, cakes and cookies, fruit and a big roast pig. The tea ceremony is usually done the day of the wedding, and in my culture, this is almost like the actual wedding.  For them, exchanging vows is nice to watch, but the serving of the tea and acceptance into the family is when the couple actually becomes \"married.\" So to my family at least, we&#039;re pretty much married ;). \n\nWe decided to combine both of these 2 events into one big day so my grandparents who can&#039;t come to Mexico could celebrate with us.  I&#039;m wearing a Chinese style qi pao, and you&#039;ll see some of my family members in the Vietnamese ao dai. I&#039;m half Chinese and half Vietnamese, so we tend to have traditions from both cultures. My FI&#039;s family is Korean, and we encouraged his mom to wear a traditional Korean dress - a hanbook.\n\n[img]http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/6flbirb1f\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/wix0ktjjf\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s1.postimg.org\/8q626zczz\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s13.postimg.org\/56mz07y1z\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s17.postimg.org\/l6ydud3bj\/image.png[\/img][\/quote]The pictures look great!!  What a fun event and great way to celebrate with friends and family, very cool to see different traditions.  Love your red dress!","Attachments":[],"Id":1868189,"PostDate":1408689845,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 21 August 2014 - 08:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We had our Vietnamese\/Chinese engagement party and tea ceremony on Saturday, and I wanted to share some pics with you ladies! In my culture, these are both big events.\u00a0 The engagement party is when the bride and groom become officially engaged and accepted by the family.\u00a0 The groom's family brings a lot of gifts to the bride's family like money, tea, wine, cakes and cookies, fruit and a big roast pig. The tea ceremony is usually done the day of the wedding, and in my culture, this is almost like the actual wedding.\u00a0 For them, exchanging vows is nice to watch, but the serving of the tea and acceptance into the family is when the couple actually becomes \"married.\" So to my family at least, we're pretty much married <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We decided to combine both of these 2 events into one big day so my grandparents who can't come to Mexico could celebrate with us.\u00a0 I'm wearing a Chinese style qi pao, and you'll see some of my family members in the Vietnamese ao dai. I'm half Chinese and half Vietnamese, so we tend to have traditions from both cultures. My FI's family is Korean, and we encouraged his mom to wear a traditional Korean dress - a hanbook.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/6flbirb1f\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/wix0ktjjf\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s1.postimg.org\/8q626zczz\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s13.postimg.org\/56mz07y1z\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s17.postimg.org\/l6ydud3bj\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>The pictures look great!! \u00a0What a fun event and great way to celebrate with friends and family, very cool to see different traditions. \u00a0Love your red dress!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357649661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.41.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa4593d1a37df7eecbf70bf5f5bc7f2f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; Congrats! Our family didn&#039;t really mind having a small tea ceremony so are planning to have a tea ceremony in Mexico.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Beautiful qipao! I ordered mine a couple of weeks ago on Taobao and we are asking my fiance&#039;s parents to bring it back to Canada after. I hope my measurements are correct and that it fits!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868355,"PostDate":1408734377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>\u00a0 Congrats! Our family didn't really mind having a small tea ceremony so are planning to have a tea ceremony in Mexico.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Beautiful qipao! I ordered mine a couple of weeks ago on Taobao and we are asking my fiance's parents to bring it back to Canada after. I hope my measurements are correct and that it fits!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our Awesome <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wevideo.com\/hub\/#media\/ci\/113639543'>Video<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/itslegendary2014.wix.com\/fasa'>Website<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/'>Riu Palace Riviera Maya Planning Thread<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1864158'>Pre-wedding photos<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1905375'>Pre-wedding photos Part II<\/a>,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878020'>OOT Baskets<\/a>, <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878578'>Centrepieces<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1852686'>DIY - Giant Crepe Roses<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867378'>DIY - Hangers & Boutonnieres<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867696'>DIY - Kissing Menu\/I Spy & Guestbook<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/page-6#entry1878023'>More DIYs - Passport to Riviera Maya, Bookmarks, Tumbler Inserts, Luggage Tags, Keycard Holder Inserts, Something Special for You Inserts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"elsa_jam@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"23.16.109.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372262718,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270962.png?_r=1397000926","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Icis","Id":270962,"Name":"Icis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.40.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2946c968cd22317454f022c417b993ac","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1868144\" timestamp=\"1408678524\"]\nWe had our Vietnamese\/Chinese engagement party and tea ceremony on Saturday, and I wanted to share some pics with you ladies! In my culture, these are both big events.  The engagement party is when the bride and groom become officially engaged and accepted by the family.  The groom&#039;s family brings a lot of gifts to the bride&#039;s family like money, tea, wine, cakes and cookies, fruit and a big roast pig. The tea ceremony is usually done the day of the wedding, and in my culture, this is almost like the actual wedding.  For them, exchanging vows is nice to watch, but the serving of the tea and acceptance into the family is when the couple actually becomes \"married.\" So to my family at least, we&#039;re pretty much married ;). \n\nWe decided to combine both of these 2 events into one big day so my grandparents who can&#039;t come to Mexico could celebrate with us.  I&#039;m wearing a Chinese style qi pao, and you&#039;ll see some of my family members in the Vietnamese ao dai. I&#039;m half Chinese and half Vietnamese, so we tend to have traditions from both cultures. My FI&#039;s family is Korean, and we encouraged his mom to wear a traditional Korean dress - a hanbook.\n\n[img]http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/6flbirb1f\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/wix0ktjjf\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s1.postimg.org\/8q626zczz\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s13.postimg.org\/56mz07y1z\/image.png[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s17.postimg.org\/l6ydud3bj\/image.png[\/img][\/quote]\nYou both look so happy and the pictures are great! I love seeing things like this! Was it in Toronto? Thanks so much for sharing it all!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1868358,"PostDate":1408736769,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 21 August 2014 - 08:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We had our Vietnamese\/Chinese engagement party and tea ceremony on Saturday, and I wanted to share some pics with you ladies! In my culture, these are both big events.\u00a0 The engagement party is when the bride and groom become officially engaged and accepted by the family.\u00a0 The groom's family brings a lot of gifts to the bride's family like money, tea, wine, cakes and cookies, fruit and a big roast pig. The tea ceremony is usually done the day of the wedding, and in my culture, this is almost like the actual wedding.\u00a0 For them, exchanging vows is nice to watch, but the serving of the tea and acceptance into the family is when the couple actually becomes \"married.\" So to my family at least, we're pretty much married <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We decided to combine both of these 2 events into one big day so my grandparents who can't come to Mexico could celebrate with us.\u00a0 I'm wearing a Chinese style qi pao, and you'll see some of my family members in the Vietnamese ao dai. I'm half Chinese and half Vietnamese, so we tend to have traditions from both cultures. My FI's family is Korean, and we encouraged his mom to wear a traditional Korean dress - a hanbook.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s27.postimg.org\/6flbirb1f\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/wix0ktjjf\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s1.postimg.org\/8q626zczz\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s13.postimg.org\/56mz07y1z\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s17.postimg.org\/l6ydud3bj\/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You both look so happy and the pictures are great! I love seeing things like this! Was it in Toronto? Thanks so much for sharing it all!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283433799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":304,"TotalPages":31,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":300},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
