{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1410723313,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65e0157353d3752d8840f81613c9c59e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1871801\" timestamp=\"1410748317\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - I thought about it but I was afraid of it not printing well so I just printed them on regular cardstock! 10 to a sheet double sided - worked out fine and it was definitely even cheaper I think than Vistaprint.  Cutting paper is SO tedious though.\n\nI&#039;m going to do the same for tip\/room key inserts - add that to my list\n\nDef. not looking forward to taking the labels off - I don&#039;t think I&#039;ll be able to wrangle my FI into helping either but my mom probably will :)[\/quote]You didn&#039;t think vista print would print well? I&#039;ve heard great reviews. Mine won&#039;t be double sided so they can change things out (thinking of them using them again!)\n\nI planned to just use regular cardstock too but I got that vistaprint groupon. Luggage tag front inserts will be the last item so if not enough $$ will make myself.  \n\nMy fianc\u00e9 suggested soaking in hot water to loosen glue. Not sure??  I have goo gone and that helped but still uber tedious. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1871802,"PostDate":1410723293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 14 September 2014 - 07:31 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - I thought about it but I was afraid of it not printing well so I just printed them on regular cardstock! 10 to a sheet double sided - worked out fine and it was definitely even cheaper I think than Vistaprint.  Cutting paper is SO tedious though.<br><br>\nI'm going to do the same for tip\/room key inserts - add that to my list<br><br>\nDef. not looking forward to taking the labels off - I don't think I'll be able to wrangle my FI into helping either but my mom probably will <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nYou didn't think vista print would print well? I've heard great reviews. Mine won't be double sided so they can change things out (thinking of them using them again!)<br><br>\nI planned to just use regular cardstock too but I got that vistaprint groupon. Luggage tag front inserts will be the last item so if not enough $$ will make myself.  <br><br>\nMy fianc\u00e9 suggested soaking in hot water to loosen glue. Not sure??  I have goo gone and that helped but still uber tedious. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40252f786d6011d759f51c148bea6a33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - I think Vistaprint is fine (planning on using them to print my door hangers and thank you\/itinerary cards). I meant not print well because I copied the Cancun pic off the Internet :) and I was worried it&#039;d print grainy because of low resolution so I just printed them myself&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will try the hot water! I have 40 cups to do :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871803,"PostDate":1410723426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - I think Vistaprint is fine (planning on using them to print my door hangers and thank you\/itinerary cards). I meant not print well because I copied the Cancun pic off the Internet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and I was worried it'd print grainy because of low resolution so I just printed them myself<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will try the hot water! I have 40 cups to do <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca614f5223c0216a1941c6dcf9927307","RawContent":"Ahhh makes sense :)\n\n\nLet me know how the hot water works!! I have 3 cups done and my labels I can pick up tomorrow so I&#039;ll do those ones only bahaha!!! Save the others for a cold November day!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1871805,"PostDate":1410723567,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ahhh makes sense <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nLet me know how the hot water works!! I have 3 cups done and my labels I can pick up tomorrow so I'll do those ones only bahaha!!! Save the others for a cold November day!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.152.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b69eb71e416cb326d4742c02a868cfa7","RawContent":"You have everything so planned out! I love it","Attachments":[],"Id":1872656,"PostDate":1411382852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You have everything so planned out! I love it \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morgan.rene1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.153.227","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410336399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279766.jpg?_r=1410362818","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MorganRene","Id":279766,"Name":"MorganRene","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.150.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fba6dcde89add8fa69e3a39cb43e6621","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Looking Good!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872666,"PostDate":1411387910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Looking Good!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394107976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62d3593071a5b0db2fcc97e6dca4389b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tygrrlily\"] - seriously amazing so far! &amp;nbsp;I love love love everything!! &amp;nbsp;For a non-DIY&#039;er, you did a wonderful job on the mailers :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Keep updating - I can&#039;t wait to see what is next!! &amp;nbsp;Excited to see how the TTD custom turns out as well - still love that style and I think it&#039;ll be perfect for you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872671,"PostDate":1411389629,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> - seriously amazing so far! \u00a0I love love love everything!! \u00a0For a non-DIY'er, you did a wonderful job on the mailers <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Keep updating - I can't wait to see what is next!! \u00a0Excited to see how the TTD custom turns out as well - still love that style and I think it'll be perfect for you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387559852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1411421513,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f939cdf6907e65cf4b77410ebb15eab8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks girls!&amp;nbsp; We&#039;ve been getting a GREAT response about the little packages.&amp;nbsp; People really liked the CD and a whole bunch of people told me they&#039;ve been listening to it all week :) !&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m pretty bad at the DIY stuff but here&#039;s another attempt&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/7r0foydjv\/IMG_6138.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6138.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/5obn98sod\/IMG_6139.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6139.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/njqjmk6cd\/IMG_6140.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6140.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I made all my printables for our wedding- I made a door hanger, thank you note with menu card on the back to put on plates during the reception, and a welcome letter with itinerary on the back.&amp;nbsp; Kind of bad to admit but I basically copied designs I liked from etsy :ph34r:. Also used a free printable from Weddingchicks for the last pic.&amp;nbsp; I was going to originally buy them but I decided to save some money this way.&amp;nbsp; It was actually pretty easy, and fun to play around with fonts. I need to get a hole puncher to punch the door hangers, but everything else is good to go!\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i got that $27 for $70 worth of printing from Vistaprint.&amp;nbsp; Just a note to the Canadian girls that the code wouldn&#039;t work for me on the Canadian site so I ordered through the American site. My subtotal was $72.&amp;nbsp; After shipping and taxes, I paid $17.69 + the original $27 - not bad!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m actually quite pleased with the quality.&amp;nbsp; My FI actually admired them without prompting too and said they looked really good! I went with the standard glossy card stock for the thank you and welcome letters, then upgraded the card stock on the door hangers to make it thicker.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My door hanger is a rack card (a lot smaller than I expected FYI - I should have read closer as I&#039;d have liked these a bit bigger), the welcome letter\/itinerary is an oversized postcard and the thank you letter\/menu is a medium postcard.&amp;nbsp; The printing actually looks GREAT - not blurry at all.&amp;nbsp; I was a bit worried because I got that message about low resolution, but I don&#039;t really have any images, just text, and it all printed great.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Overall pretty pleased!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872744,"PostDate":1411421195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks girls!\u00a0 We've been getting a GREAT response about the little packages.\u00a0 People really liked the CD and a whole bunch of people told me they've been listening to it all week <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm pretty bad at the DIY stuff but here's another attempt<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/7r0foydjv\/IMG_6138.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6138.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/5obn98sod\/IMG_6139.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6139.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/njqjmk6cd\/IMG_6140.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6140.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I made all my printables for our wedding- I made a door hanger, thank you note with menu card on the back to put on plates during the reception, and a welcome letter with itinerary on the back.\u00a0 Kind of bad to admit but I basically copied designs I liked from etsy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ph34r.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':ph34r:' \/>. Also used a free printable from Weddingchicks for the last pic.\u00a0 I was going to originally buy them but I decided to save some money this way.\u00a0 It was actually pretty easy, and fun to play around with fonts. I need to get a hole puncher to punch the door hangers, but everything else is good to go!<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i got that $27 for $70 worth of printing from Vistaprint.\u00a0 Just a note to the Canadian girls that the code wouldn't work for me on the Canadian site so I ordered through the American site. My subtotal was $72.\u00a0 After shipping and taxes, I paid $17.69 + the original $27 - not bad!\u00a0 I'm actually quite pleased with the quality.\u00a0 My FI actually admired them without prompting too and said they looked really good! I went with the standard glossy card stock for the thank you and welcome letters, then upgraded the card stock on the door hangers to make it thicker.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My door hanger is a rack card (a lot smaller than I expected FYI - I should have read closer as I'd have liked these a bit bigger), the welcome letter\/itinerary is an oversized postcard and the thank you letter\/menu is a medium postcard.\u00a0 The printing actually looks GREAT - not blurry at all.\u00a0 I was a bit worried because I got that message about low resolution, but I don't really have any images, just text, and it all printed great.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Overall pretty pleased!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.103.250.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b1c7cfce138c03d901981e04c80bcdb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow congratulations! You looked so beautiful! So lovely for the two of you and your families!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872762,"PostDate":1411445052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow congratulations! You looked so beautiful! So lovely for the two of you and your families!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351755768,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"677a09db8116d686a2d60c94c45ca5b4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1872744\" timestamp=\"1411446395\"]\nThanks girls!  We&#039;ve been getting a GREAT response about the little packages.  People really liked the CD and a whole bunch of people told me they&#039;ve been listening to it all week :) !\n\nI&#039;m pretty bad at the DIY stuff but here&#039;s another attempt\n\n[img]http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/7r0foydjv\/IMG_6138.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/5obn98sod\/IMG_6139.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/njqjmk6cd\/IMG_6140.jpg[\/img]\n\nI made all my printables for our wedding- I made a door hanger, thank you note with menu card on the back to put on plates during the reception, and a welcome letter with itinerary on the back.  Kind of bad to admit but I basically copied designs I liked from etsy :ph34r:. Also used a free printable from Weddingchicks for the last pic.  I was going to originally buy them but I decided to save some money this way.  It was actually pretty easy, and fun to play around with fonts. I need to get a hole puncher to punch the door hangers, but everything else is good to go!\n\ni got that $27 for $70 worth of printing from Vistaprint.  Just a note to the Canadian girls that the code wouldn&#039;t work for me on the Canadian site so I ordered through the American site. My subtotal was $72.  After shipping and taxes, I paid $17.69 + the original $27 - not bad!  I&#039;m actually quite pleased with the quality.  My FI actually admired them without prompting too and said they looked really good! I went with the standard glossy card stock for the thank you and welcome letters, then upgraded the card stock on the door hangers to make it thicker. \n\nMy door hanger is a rack card (a lot smaller than I expected FYI - I should have read closer as I&#039;d have liked these a bit bigger), the welcome letter\/itinerary is an oversized postcard and the thank you letter\/menu is a medium postcard.  The printing actually looks GREAT - not blurry at all.  I was a bit worried because I got that message about low resolution, but I don&#039;t really have any images, just text, and it all printed great.\n\nOverall pretty pleased![\/quote]I&#039;ve heard that about the groupon so I was worried about the one I bought. Mine dearly said Canada (was $30 for $60). We shall see in the next week or two when I&#039;m ready to print. \n\nAwesome job on all!!!! And don&#039;t feel bad I&#039;m sure everyone uses ideas from etsy or Pinterest and re duplicates! \n\nHave you bought business cards? I tend to lean to the personal ones as I can get 50 (don&#039;t need 100). It doesn&#039;t look like the cardstock is different\/cheaper just less designs to choose from. Curious if anyone had experience with this. \n\nAgain great job! Love seeing your ideas. I guess it&#039;s my turn next :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1872780,"PostDate":1411451736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 22 September 2014 - 09:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thanks girls!  We've been getting a GREAT response about the little packages.  People really liked the CD and a whole bunch of people told me they've been listening to it all week <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> !<br><br>\nI'm pretty bad at the DIY stuff but here's another attempt<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/7r0foydjv\/IMG_6138.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6138.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/5obn98sod\/IMG_6139.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6139.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/njqjmk6cd\/IMG_6140.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6140.jpg\"><\/span><br><br>\nI made all my printables for our wedding- I made a door hanger, thank you note with menu card on the back to put on plates during the reception, and a welcome letter with itinerary on the back.  Kind of bad to admit but I basically copied designs I liked from etsy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ph34r.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':ph34r:' \/>. Also used a free printable from Weddingchicks for the last pic.  I was going to originally buy them but I decided to save some money this way.  It was actually pretty easy, and fun to play around with fonts. I need to get a hole puncher to punch the door hangers, but everything else is good to go!<br><br>\ni got that $27 for $70 worth of printing from Vistaprint.  Just a note to the Canadian girls that the code wouldn't work for me on the Canadian site so I ordered through the American site. My subtotal was $72.  After shipping and taxes, I paid $17.69 + the original $27 - not bad!  I'm actually quite pleased with the quality.  My FI actually admired them without prompting too and said they looked really good! I went with the standard glossy card stock for the thank you and welcome letters, then upgraded the card stock on the door hangers to make it thicker. <br><br>\nMy door hanger is a rack card (a lot smaller than I expected FYI - I should have read closer as I'd have liked these a bit bigger), the welcome letter\/itinerary is an oversized postcard and the thank you letter\/menu is a medium postcard.  The printing actually looks GREAT - not blurry at all.  I was a bit worried because I got that message about low resolution, but I don't really have any images, just text, and it all printed great.<br><br>\nOverall pretty pleased!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI've heard that about the groupon so I was worried about the one I bought. Mine dearly said Canada (was $30 for $60). We shall see in the next week or two when I'm ready to print. <br><br>\nAwesome job on all!!!! And don't feel bad I'm sure everyone uses ideas from etsy or Pinterest and re duplicates! <br><br>\nHave you bought business cards? I tend to lean to the personal ones as I can get 50 (don't need 100). It doesn't look like the cardstock is different\/cheaper just less designs to choose from. Curious if anyone had experience with this. <br><br>\nAgain great job! Love seeing your ideas. I guess it's my turn next <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.156.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32d4af669ff39e8c2e3cece81ff90031","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1872744\" timestamp=\"1411446395\"]\nThanks girls!  We&#039;ve been getting a GREAT response about the little packages.  People really liked the CD and a whole bunch of people told me they&#039;ve been listening to it all week :) !\n\nI&#039;m pretty bad at the DIY stuff but here&#039;s another attempt\n\n[img]http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/7r0foydjv\/IMG_6138.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/5obn98sod\/IMG_6139.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/njqjmk6cd\/IMG_6140.jpg[\/img]\n\nI made all my printables for our wedding- I made a door hanger, thank you note with menu card on the back to put on plates during the reception, and a welcome letter with itinerary on the back.  Kind of bad to admit but I basically copied designs I liked from etsy :ph34r:. Also used a free printable from Weddingchicks for the last pic.  I was going to originally buy them but I decided to save some money this way.  It was actually pretty easy, and fun to play around with fonts. I need to get a hole puncher to punch the door hangers, but everything else is good to go!\n\ni got that $27 for $70 worth of printing from Vistaprint.  Just a note to the Canadian girls that the code wouldn&#039;t work for me on the Canadian site so I ordered through the American site. My subtotal was $72.  After shipping and taxes, I paid $17.69 + the original $27 - not bad!  I&#039;m actually quite pleased with the quality.  My FI actually admired them without prompting too and said they looked really good! I went with the standard glossy card stock for the thank you and welcome letters, then upgraded the card stock on the door hangers to make it thicker. \n\nMy door hanger is a rack card (a lot smaller than I expected FYI - I should have read closer as I&#039;d have liked these a bit bigger), the welcome letter\/itinerary is an oversized postcard and the thank you letter\/menu is a medium postcard.  The printing actually looks GREAT - not blurry at all.  I was a bit worried because I got that message about low resolution, but I don&#039;t really have any images, just text, and it all printed great.\n\nOverall pretty pleased![\/quote]Thank you for putting what you used!  I&#039;ve been waffling about getting the Groupon because I don&#039;t know what size to use!  How long did they take to arrive?  I&#039;m not printing until January or February, so I want to be sure the deal lasts lol (most expire this year)","Attachments":[],"Id":1872798,"PostDate":1411455244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 22 September 2014 - 09:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thanks girls!  We've been getting a GREAT response about the little packages.  People really liked the CD and a whole bunch of people told me they've been listening to it all week <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> !<br><br>\nI'm pretty bad at the DIY stuff but here's another attempt<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/7r0foydjv\/IMG_6138.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6138.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/5obn98sod\/IMG_6139.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6139.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/njqjmk6cd\/IMG_6140.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6140.jpg\"><\/span><br><br>\nI made all my printables for our wedding- I made a door hanger, thank you note with menu card on the back to put on plates during the reception, and a welcome letter with itinerary on the back.  Kind of bad to admit but I basically copied designs I liked from etsy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ph34r.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':ph34r:' \/>. Also used a free printable from Weddingchicks for the last pic.  I was going to originally buy them but I decided to save some money this way.  It was actually pretty easy, and fun to play around with fonts. I need to get a hole puncher to punch the door hangers, but everything else is good to go!<br><br>\ni got that $27 for $70 worth of printing from Vistaprint.  Just a note to the Canadian girls that the code wouldn't work for me on the Canadian site so I ordered through the American site. My subtotal was $72.  After shipping and taxes, I paid $17.69 + the original $27 - not bad!  I'm actually quite pleased with the quality.  My FI actually admired them without prompting too and said they looked really good! I went with the standard glossy card stock for the thank you and welcome letters, then upgraded the card stock on the door hangers to make it thicker. <br><br>\nMy door hanger is a rack card (a lot smaller than I expected FYI - I should have read closer as I'd have liked these a bit bigger), the welcome letter\/itinerary is an oversized postcard and the thank you letter\/menu is a medium postcard.  The printing actually looks GREAT - not blurry at all.  I was a bit worried because I got that message about low resolution, but I don't really have any images, just text, and it all printed great.<br><br>\nOverall pretty pleased!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThank you for putting what you used!  I've been waffling about getting the Groupon because I don't know what size to use!  How long did they take to arrive?  I'm not printing until January or February, so I want to be sure the deal lasts lol (most expire this year)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387559852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":304,"TotalPages":31,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":300},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
